13.533345                alpha1      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA>alpha0. (deg)
-11.836493               alpha2      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA<alpha0. (deg)
